# Client-side routing. A request for /adminHome/loans/123 has no file behind
# it, so Cloudflare Pages serves index.html and lets React Router resolve it.
# Pages matches real static assets first, so /assets/* is unaffected. The 200
# (rather than a 301/302) is what makes this a rewrite instead of a redirect,
# so the browser keeps the URL the member actually asked for.
/*    /index.html   200
